OL,3,GNEWSAHopes porpoise net recording can
OL,4,Ahelp stop deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FScientists are hoping a recording of a
OL,7,Fporpoise trapped in a net could help
OL,8,Fthem develop practical ways of avoiding
OL,9,Fmarine animal deaths in the future.
OL,11,FResearchers from the University of St
OL,12,FAndrews found their acoustic monitoring
OL,13,Fkit had recorded two harbour porpoises
OL,14,Fforaging near a static fishing net off
OL,15,Fthe coast of Cornwall.
OL,17,FThey said the porpoises appeared to be
OL,18,Faware of the net but after becoming
OL,19,Fdistracted, one had become entangled
OL,20,Fand could lift it but not escape.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
