OL,3,GNEWSAHopes porpoise net recording can
OL,4,Ahelp stop deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Jamie Macaulay, lead author of the
OL,7,Fpaper documenting the event, said the
OL,8,Finsights gained could "be crucial" in
OL,9,Fdeveloping nets which would be more
OL,10,Fnoticeable and allow larger species to
OL,11,Fbreak free from.
